      <section class="case-detail-grid">
        <div class="bullet-panel">
          <h2 class="en">Strategy & Execution</h2>
          <h2 class="zh">策略与执行</h2>
          <ul class="en">
            <li><strong>Plan content around buying decisions: </strong>Used customer needs and search intent to plan blogs, buying guides, collection pages, and product pages. Linked these pages to help readers find products. Along with page and technical improvements, the project recorded $260K+ in organic search revenue. Revenue in the latest six-month period grew 133.5% versus the previous comparable period.</li>
            <li><strong>Tell the brand story on key pages: </strong>Worked on homepage and About Us copy. Explained the brand story and product value in clear English, keeping the message consistent across brand and product content.</li>
            <li><strong>Test ideas on collection and product pages: </strong>Improved keywords, titles, descriptions, copy, images, and internal links. Tried A/B tests on collection and product pages to guide further content and conversion improvements.</li>
            <li><strong>Recover traffic by improving content: </strong>Used GSC data to find overlapping topics and pages with unclear roles. Merged similar content and added reliable sources and original analysis. Daily search clicks recovered from single digits to about 100 within three months.</li>
            <li><strong>Turn technical audits into completed fixes: </strong>Checked crawling, indexing, canonicals, redirects, duplicate content, schema, and Core Web Vitals. Set priorities, worked with developers, and checked the changes after release. The site passed Core Web Vitals with LCP of 1.7s, INP of 121ms, and CLS of 0.</li>
            <li><strong>Coordinate writers and off-site content: </strong>Sent briefs to freelance writers and followed up on their work. Supported regular publishing and site authority through relevant backlinks, short-form content, and digital PR content.</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="zh">
            <li><strong>以购买决策组织内容：</strong>根据消费者需求、购买顾虑和搜索意图，明确博客、购买指南、集合页与产品页的分工，通过主题集群和内链连接信息研究与产品发现。结合页面和技术优化，项目累计自然搜索营收超过26万美元，近6个月较前一等长周期增长133.5%。</li>
            <li><strong>让品牌故事进入关键页面：</strong>参与首页与 About Us 文案，将品牌定位、品牌故事和产品价值转化为面向消费者的英文表达，让品牌叙事与产品教育保持一致。</li>
            <li><strong>通过页面测试验证优化方向：</strong>优化集合页与产品页的关键词、标题、描述、文案、图片和内链，并尝试 A/B 测试，为后续内容及转化体验调整提供依据。</li>
            <li><strong>通过内容重构恢复搜索流量：</strong>结合 GSC 数据和受影响页面特征，识别主题重叠与页面定位问题，整合内容并补充权威资料和原创分析，使日均搜索点击在约三个月内从个位数恢复至约100次。</li>
            <li><strong>将技术诊断推进到上线验收：</strong>审计抓取、收录、Canonical、重定向、重复内容、Schema 与 Core Web Vitals，确定修复优先级并与开发人员协作落地。网站通过 Core Web Vitals 评估，LCP 为1.7秒、INP 为121毫秒、CLS 为0。</li>
            <li><strong>协调内容生产与站外建设：</strong>向自由撰稿人发布内容 Brief，跟进沟通与交付，并通过相关外链、短内容分发与数字公关内容，支持内容持续发布和站外权威建设。</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="case-note en">Organic search revenue exceeded $260K in total. Revenue in the latest six-month period grew 133.5% versus the previous comparable period.</p>
          <p class="case-note zh">累计自然搜索营收超过26万美元；近6个月营收较前一等长周期增长133.5%。</p>
